{"ref":"BDB, אֲחִיָּ֫הוּ","hw":"אֲחִיָּ֫הוּ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִיָּ֫הוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִיָּה</span></big>  † <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִיָּ֫הוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִיָּה</span></big> (always, except where other form noted), <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִי</span> <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>brother of Yah</em>(<em>u</em>), cf. Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">חמלך</span> <em>brother of Milk</em>, & especially <span dir=\"rtl\">אחתמלך</span> <em>sister of Milk</em>, where <span dir=\"rtl\">אחת</span> must be cstr. since <span dir=\"rtl\">מלך</span> is a male deity; cf. Carth. <span dir=\"rtl\">חתמלקרת</span> Euting <sup>213</sup><strong>)</strong>.<br/><br><strong>1.</strong>  a priest <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.3\">1 S 14:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.18\">18</a>.<br/><br><strong>2.</strong>  a scribe <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.3\">1 K 4:3</a>.<br/><br><strong>3.</strong>  a prophet <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:29\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.29\">1 K 11:29</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:30\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.30\">30</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 12:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.12.15\">12:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:2\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.2\">14:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.4\">4</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:29\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.29\">15:29</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:29\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.29\">2 Ch 9:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.4\">1 K 14:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:18\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.18\">18</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 10:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.10.15\">2 Ch 10:15</a> (last five <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִיָּהוּ</span>).<br/><br><strong>4.</strong>  father of king Baasha <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:27\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.27\">1 K 15:27</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:33\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.33\">33</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:22\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.22\">21:22</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.9\">2 K 9:9</a>.<br/><br><strong>5.</strong>  grandson of Hezron <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.25\">1 Ch 2:25</a>, or perhaps <strong>n.pr.f.</strong>, mother of preceding four, cf. Be.<br/><br><strong>6.</strong>  son of Ehud, of Benj. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.7\">1 Ch 8:7</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחוֹחַ</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.4\">4</a>.<br/><br><strong>7.</strong>  one of Dvd’s heroes <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.36\">1 Ch 11:36</a>.<br/><br><strong>8.</strong>  a Levite, Dvd’s time <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.20\">1 Ch 26:20</a>.<br/><br><strong>9.</strong>  a chief man under Nehem. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:27\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.27\">Ne 10:27</a>.<br><strong>10.</strong>  a Gadite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.15\">1 Ch 5:15</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֲחִי)</span>.<br><strong>11.</strong>  a man of Asher <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:34\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.34\">1 Ch 7:34</a> (<em>id.</em>)","next":"BDB, אֲחִיהוּד","prev":"BDB, אֲחִיאָם"}